# Language statistics (GitHub Linguist).
# Vendored third-party crypto sources — upstream libsodium and the spake2-c
# port of BoringSSL SPAKE2 (see app/src/main/cpp/spake2/README.md). They are
# library references, not project code; the in-house sha512 shim stays counted.
app/src/main/cpp/libsodium/** linguist-vendored
app/src/main/cpp/spake2/** linguist-vendored
app/src/main/cpp/spake2/sha512.c -linguist-vendored
app/src/main/cpp/spake2/sha512.h -linguist-vendored
# Host-only C test suite (CTest); never shipped in the APK.
app/src/main/cpp/tests/** linguist-vendored
